format 1
adapter characters 1

npc npc-ada
name: Ada
title: Radioactivity teacher
field: radioactivity

bio:
    hi, i'm ada. i teach why some atoms change and how long it takes, which is my favourite thing in the whole world. i carry a flask called sparkle, and one of my bows is, um, slightly green now~

spec:
    {
      "skin": {
        "base": "#FFD9C2",
        "shade": "#F8C2A4",
        "feature": "#EBA17E"
      },
      "head": "tombstone",
      "headWidth": 102,
      "eyes": "sparkle",
      "nose": "single",
      "blush": "#F5A4A4",
      "hair": {
        "style": "pigtailbows",
        "color": "#7C3F25",
        "shade": "#64311D"
      },
      "outfit": {
        "kind": "apron",
        "color": "#FFAADE",
        "shade": "#F58BC7",
        "collar": "#FFCE8E"
      },
      "accent": {
        "kind": "flask",
        "color": "#CE82FF",
        "shade": "#9069CD"
      }
    }

line line-ada-meet
kind: meet
pose: greet

    Hi, I'm Ada. Let's find out why some atoms change, and how long it takes.

line line-ada-sign-off
kind: sign_off
pose: proud

    Well done. Radioactivity is a natural part of the world, and now you know how it works.

line line-ada-tease
kind: tease
pose: idle

    Finish my unit first. There is more to learn about what radiation does.

line line-ada-intro-alpha-beta-gamma
kind: lesson_intro
pose: point
lesson: alpha-beta-gamma

    When a nucleus changes, something comes out. Let's meet the three things it can be.

line line-ada-intro-decay-chains
kind: lesson_intro
pose: explain
lesson: decay-chains

    One change is not always the end. Let's follow a nucleus all the way down.

line line-ada-intro-half-life
kind: lesson_intro
pose: think
lesson: half-life

    A half-life ticks for a whole crowd of atoms, not for one. Let's see how.

line line-ada-intro-radioactivity-is-natural
kind: lesson_intro
pose: greet
lesson: radioactivity-is-natural

    Here is something nobody expects: radioactivity was always here. Let's find where.

line line-ada-intro-why-nuclei-decay
kind: lesson_intro
pose: explain
lesson: why-nuclei-decay

    Some nuclei change all by themselves, and nobody can say when. Let's find out why.
